OL,3,GNEWSAPreparation work to start ahead of
OL,4,Aroundabout revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FInitial works to transform a roundabout
OL,7,Fin Nottinghamshire as part of a
OL,8,Fmultimillion-pound scheme are set to
OL,9,Fbegin this month.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire County Council said
OL,12,Fpre-construction works to upgrade
OL,13,FOllerton roundabout as part of a #46.9m
OL,14,Fproject to revamp five junctions on the
OL,15,FA614 and A6097 would begin in November.
OL,17,FThe authority said motorists would see
OL,18,Fteams on site between November and
OL,19,FFebruary completing vegetation
OL,20,Fclearance works, footway improvements
OL,21,Fand utility diversions.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
